{"path":"types/numeric_limits/quiet_NaN","title":"std::numeric_limits<T>::quiet_NaN","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::numeric_limits&lt;T&gt;::</span>quiet_NaN","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits/quiet_NaN","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the special value \"quiet not-a-number\", as represented by the floating-point type T. Only meaningful if std::numeric_limits<T>::has_quiet_NaN == true.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> T quiet_NaN<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">throw</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T quiet_NaN<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the special value \"quiet <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NaN\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">not-a-number</a>\", as represented by the floating-point type <code>T</code>. Only meaningful if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">has_quiet_NaN</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>. In IEEE 754, the most common binary representation of floating-point numbers, any value with all bits of the exponent set and at least one bit of the fraction set represents a NaN. It is implementation-defined which values of the fraction represent quiet or signaling NaNs, and whether the sign bit is meaningful.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  <code>T</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">quiet_NaN</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* non-specialized */</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">T<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">signed</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr c